"html": "<html><head><title data-react-helmet=\"true\">中美俄“三巨头”峰会结束：涉及乌克兰、伊朗议题，发表和平宣言承诺核对话 - BBC News 中文</title>\n<meta data-react-helmet=\"true\" property=\"og:title\" content=\"中美俄“三巨头”峰会结束：涉及乌克兰、伊朗议题，发表和平宣言承诺核对话 - BBC News 中文\"/>\n\"datePublished\":\"2026-11-19T12:22:04.158Z\"</head><body><nav><p>首页 中国 国际 台湾 香港 评论 视频 专题 更多新闻 订阅电子报 下载应用程序</p></nav><div class=\"css-1nude9v\"><main role=\"main\" class=\"css-uarkay\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"css-5youcd e17x9cvu0\"><h1 tabindex=\"-1\" id=\"content\" class=\"article-heading css-nir6jv e1j37txl0\">中美俄“三巨头”峰会结束：涉及乌克兰、伊朗议题，发表和平宣言承诺核对话</h1></div><figure class=\"css-1qn0xuy\"><div class=\"css-1f9kdg2\" style=\"padding-bottom:56.24%\"><img src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/ws/640/cpsprodpb/1b0f/live/68aa4e30-e40f-11f1-b37c-b3a71d7200af.jpg.webp\" srcSet=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/ws/240/cpsprodpb/1b0f/live/68aa4e30-e40f-11f1-b37c-b3a71d7200af.jpg.webp 240w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/ws/320/cpsprodpb/1b0f/live/68aa4e30-e40f-11f1-b37c-b3a71d7200af.jpg.webp 320w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/ws/480/cpsprodpb/1b0f/live/68aa4e30-e40f-11f1-b37c-b3a71d7200af.jpg.webp 480w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/ws/624/cpsprodpb/1b0f/live/68aa4e30-e40f-11f1-b37c-b3a71d7200af.jpg.webp 624w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/ws/800/cpsprodpb/1b0f/live/68aa4e30-e40f-11f1-b37c-b3a71d7200af.jpg.webp 800w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1008px) 760px, 100vw\" alt=\"习近平、普京、特朗普首次三方会谈\" loading=\"eager\" width=\"5565\" height=\"3130\" fetchPriority=\"high\" style=\"aspect-ratio:5565 / 3130\" class=\"css-1seqhu9\"/><p class=\"Copyright_copyright__LGY24 css-vc8auw\" role=\"text\"><span class=\"VisuallyHiddenText_visuallyHiddenText__NazL3\">图像来源，</span><span lang=\"en-GB\">Reuters</span></p></div><figcaption class=\"css-s0c06d\" dir=\"ltr\"><span role=\"text\"><span class=\"VisuallyHiddenText_visuallyHiddenText__NazL3\">图像加注文字，</span><span data-testid=\"caption-paragraph\">11月19日，习近平、普京、特朗普首次三方会谈</span></span></figcaption></figure><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"css-1k9op6x e17x9cvu0\"><span class=\"VisuallyHiddenText_visuallyHiddenText__NazL3\">Published </span><time dateTime=\"2026-11-19\" class=\"Timestamp_timestamp__JG_lw\">2026年11月19日</time></div><div class=\"ReadTime_readTimeContainer__tlSrG\" data-testid=\"read-time\"><span class=\"ReadTime_readTimeText__Oo1r7 css-vc8auw\">阅读时间: 3 分钟</span></div><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"css-1k9op6x e17x9cvu0\"><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"css-yezvz5 emv7gn60\" data-sticky-nav-anchor=\"true\">11月19日下午4时30分左右，中美俄三方峰会在深圳麒麟山庄开始，会谈历时约90分钟。三位领导人过去曾出席同场国际会议，但这是他们首次举行三方闭门会晤。</p></div><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"css-1k9op6x e17x9cvu0\"><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"css-yezvz5 emv7gn60\" data-sticky-nav-anchor=\"true\">会后发表的《中俄美元首和平宣言》显示，三国领导人承诺就减少核风险、防止核扩散展开对话，并就联合国改革、能源稳定和国际刑事法院管辖权等议题达成四点共识。</p></main><section id=\"topic-discovery-component\" aria-labelledby=\"topic-discovery-heading\" class=\"css-1ys4koj\" data-testid=\"topic-discovery\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"topic-discovery-heading\" class=\"css-dd4ych\">发现更多</h2><div class=\"css-1tkgjh9\"><div class=\"css-4g50tk\"><button type=\"button\" disabled=\"\" aria-label=\"Scroll tabs left\" data-testid=\"scroll-start\" class=\"css-1fzap66\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"external-svg icons_mask__cO6__ css-1xdhyk6\" style=\"--icon-source:url(&quot;https://static.files.bbci.co.uk/ws/simorgh-assets/public/images/icons/chevron-backward.svg&quot;);--icon-width:12px;--icon-</body></html>"
